#~ "fantasy theme and role-playing elements. The game is available for "
#~ "Microsoft Windows, Apple OS X, and various GNU/Linux distributions."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<em>8. marts 2008</em>. Holdet bag Kampen om Wesnoth er stolt over at "
#~ "kunne udgive version 1.4 af <em>Kampen om Wesnoth</em>, et <a "
#~ "href='http://www.gnu.org/philosophy/philosophy.html'>frit</a>, "
